        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chapter 1 is now available!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592990/extras/4fb7f0dd2ad40165cba67a1c2440a26a.avif?t=1782305895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592990/extras_big/4fb7f0dd2ad40165cba67a1c2440a26a.webp?t=1782305895 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hibridya is a fantasy, romance and slice-of-life visual novel that tells the story of Alice, a 17-year-old girl who lives her life normally until a mysterious event suddenly takes her to an unknown place. A place where magical beings exist, beings she admires and only sees in stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the world of hybrids: Hibridya. A world that has a strong connection to Earth since its origin and that hides a great secret. A secret that only a few know…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wandering in search of help, Alice encounters those who insist that she is a princess named Evangeline, the princess of the kingdom where she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst all this, she is saved by a mysterious young man who takes her to a place where she gets to meet those who will be her future roommates while she tries to find a way to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice will make new friends, learn new things and also about herself! Furthermore, she may (or may not) experience a romance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did Alice mysteriously end up in Hibridya, and why was she mistaken for the princess of this kingdom? How will she manage to get back home? Will she really be able to do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story with 7 chapters in total + prologue and epilogue (each chapter will be released separately);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 84k words. Around 6~7 hours of content (for now, only the prologue and chapter 1);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 romantic interests (one of them will only appear at the end of chapter 3) and who knows, maybe something more?;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a romance only if you want! Choose whether to follow the friendship or romance route;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable name;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 text fonts (in addition to the default font) for better accessibility;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original backgrounds, CGs, sprites and interface;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices to customize your experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ending variations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NOTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At a certain point in the game, the player will have the option to choose between to follow the friendship or romance route with one of the romantic interests. This option will appear later for the second romantic interest. However, this will only happen if specific choices are made throughout the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything that makes up this Visual Novel and its development, except for the soundtrack, was made by AyaChi-mi, creator of Colora Games. The source of the music and sound effects is the website </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chapter 1 is now available!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592990/extras/4fb7f0dd2ad40165cba67a1c2440a26a.avif?t=1782305895\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592990/extras_big/4fb7f0dd2ad40165cba67a1c2440a26a.webp?t=1782305895 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hibridya is a fantasy, romance and slice-of-life visual novel that tells the story of Alice, a 17-year-old girl who lives her life normally until a mysterious event suddenly takes her to an unknown place. A place where magical beings exist, beings she admires and only sees in stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the world of hybrids: Hibridya. A world that has a strong connection to Earth since its origin and that hides a great secret. A secret that only a few know…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wandering in search of help, Alice encounters those who insist that she is a princess named Evangeline, the princess of the kingdom where she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst all this, she is saved by a mysterious young man who takes her to a place where she gets to meet those who will be her future roommates while she tries to find a way to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice will make new friends, learn new things and also about herself! Furthermore, she may (or may not) experience a romance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did Alice mysteriously end up in Hibridya, and why was she mistaken for the princess of this kingdom? How will she manage to get back home? Will she really be able to do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story with 7 chapters in total + prologue and epilogue (each chapter will be released separately);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 84k words. Around 6~7 hours of content (for now, only the prologue and chapter 1);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 romantic interests (one of them will only appear at the end of chapter 3) and who knows, maybe something more?;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a romance only if you want! Choose whether to follow the friendship or romance route;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable name;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 text fonts (in addition to the default font) for better accessibility;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original backgrounds, CGs, sprites and interface;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices to customize your experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ending variations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NOTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At a certain point in the game, the player will have the option to choose between to follow the friendship or romance route with one of the romantic interests. This option will appear later for the second romantic interest. However, this will only happen if specific choices are made throughout the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything that makes up this Visual Novel and its development, except for the soundtrack, was made by AyaChi-mi, creator of Colora Games. The source of the music and sound effects is the website </p>",
        "short_description": "In the blink of an eye, she gets there... but has no idea why. Hibridya is an episodic fantasy, romance and slice-of-life visual novel where you will follow a narrative full of emotions, discoveries, and plot twists, customizing the main character’s story in some ways!",
